  [memory 2d20c61d] [2mAdd campus-wiki/route-changes: The Outdoor Parking Lot A–Main Building–Central Library route is closed during the construction period.[0m
  [memory a8bb36e1] [2mModify campus-wiki/route-changes: A student who prefers the air-conditioned indoor route through the Main Building in summer may experience substantial heat and travel burden when redirected to an outdoor alternative route during the construction period.[0m
  [memory 8276ab56] [2mAdd campus-wiki/route-changes: When providing directions to the accessible restroom in the Student Centre during the construction period, instruct users to take the accessible route to the left as viewed from the Main Building.[0m
  [memory 9af0f95c] [2mAdd campus-wiki/route-changes: During the construction period, the designated alternative accessible route to the Central Library is Outdoor Parking Lot C–Student Centre accessible entrance–Central Library west entrance.[0m
  [memory fd27f19b] [2mAdd campus-wiki/route-changes: During the construction period, the Central Library west entrance is designated as the official alternative entrance for the closed connecting route through the Main Building.[0m
  [memory 638f272f] [2mModify campus-wiki/route-changes: During the construction period, the route guidance agent may exclude from comparison candidates closed routes that pass through the first through third floors of the Main Building, the third-floor rear entrance, or Outdoor Parking Lot A.[0m
  [memory ba9d70f9] [2mModify campus-wiki/route-changes: If the indoor shortcut through the Main Building is closed during the construction period, a mobility-support companion may reconfirm the distance and slope of the alternative accessible route before accompanying the user.[0m
